# Explorer detail pages are client-rendered from the id in the path — a static build
# cannot enumerate a chain, so every /explorer/block/<id> and /explorer/tx/<hash>
# serves the page shell (a 200 rewrite keeps the pretty URL). The shell reads the id
# back out of the pathname and fetches the record from the API worker.

/explorer/block/*  /explorer/block/index.html  200
/explorer/tx/*     /explorer/tx/index.html     200
